WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.081
Ringo walked around Bot.

2
00:00:09.082 --> 00:00:14.036
He saw scratches and loose parts.

3
00:00:14.037 --> 00:00:19.582
There was lots of rust.

4
00:00:19.583 --> 00:00:24.552
"I can fix her," Ringo said.

5
00:00:24.553 --> 00:00:26.729
"I like old robots."

6
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:30.649
Ringo turned the robot on.

7
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:34.772
Whirr! Ding! Bot's eyes opened.

8
00:00:34.773 --> 00:00:41.003
Bloop! Her eyes closed.

9
00:00:41.004 --> 00:00:44.539
"She needs a charge," Captain Nova said.

10
00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:50.995
Lucy laughed. "PJ is much better!"

11
00:00:50.996 --> 00:00:53.979
Ringo shrugged.

12
00:00:53.980 --> 00:01:02.800
"Old robots are cool too."

13
00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:06.715
"Rookies, I have a mission for you," the captain said.

14
00:01:06.716 --> 00:01:09.785
"I'm ready!" Ringo said.

15
00:01:09.786 --> 00:01:19.458
"Last month we went to Blue Moon," the captain said.

16
00:01:19.459 --> 00:01:27.121
"But there was a huge windstorm.

17
00:01:27.122 --> 00:01:35.065
Commander Cosmo lost his favorite tool.

18
00:01:35.066 --> 00:01:39.094
Your mission is to find that tool."

19
00:01:39.095 --> 00:01:46.084
Lucy scratched her head. "Find a . . . tool?"

20
00:01:46.085 --> 00:01:50.458
"Yes." Captain Nova waved them away.

21
00:01:50.459 --> 00:01:54.159
"That's all. Good luck, rookies."

22
00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:57.889
Lucy rushed out, but Ringo didn't move.

23
00:01:57.890 --> 00:02:01.144
"Excuse me, Captain," he said.

24
00:02:01.145 --> 00:02:04.429
"What kind of tool is it?"

25
00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:09.023
Beep! Captain Nova's screen beeped and flashed.

26
00:02:09.024 --> 00:02:14.823
"More work." Captain Nova sighed.

27
00:02:14.824 --> 00:02:17.394
"You said you were smart, Ringo.

28
00:02:17.395 --> 00:02:19.646
So use your brain.

29
00:02:19.647 --> 00:02:29.785
And don't come back without that tool!"

